text = "ADULT HUMOUR\n\nMark in Brum is a darkly comic sandbox about a rude man with poor impulse control loose in Birmingham city centre. It features toilet humour, cartoon bodily fluids (non-explicit, fully clothed), rude pedestrians, and slapstick civic chaos.\n\nNo real people, businesses, or brands are depicted. All characters are adults.\n\nA 'Reduced Grossness' option is available in the pause menu."
